menu "Sensor-Actor WiFi"

    config SA_WIFI_TEST_TIMING
        bool "Short WiFi retry timers (testing only)"
        default n
        help
            Replaces the FSD timing (10 s for 5 min, 5 min for 1 h, AP retry every 15 min)
            with 2 s for 20 s, 10 s for 40 s, AP retry every 30 s, so the reconnect and
            access-point fallback can be tested on the bench in about a minute.

endmenu
